Subject: [PATCH] Run native APT metadata inspection with locked host tools

Prepare the native Linux tools from the published build-infra APT lock without
a recursive dependency on the APT importer. Use Bazel's checksum-verifying
downloader and the locked interpreter, shared libraries and magic database.
Both AMD64 and ARM64 execute the host tools against the selected target inputs.

Origin: SONiC APT catalog reproducibility review (registry #237).
Upstream status: SONiC-specific APT extension.

